 en from Bangkok\, TH.\nThe Moon is 11° up · dark sky.\nTimes for the Moo
 n's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: htt
 ps://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=13.7540&lon=100.5014
